L["Check whether you or your pet know this exact spell ID. An unlearned spell is a valid condition that returns false, so the same rotation can adapt as you learn abilities. This does not check cooldown, resources, range, or whether the spell can currently be cast. Missing or restricted learned-state data stays unavailable under NOT."] = "檢查你或你的寵物是否學會了這個確切的法術 ID。未學會的法術是有效條件，結果為假，因此同一個循環可以隨著你學會技能而自動調整。它不檢查冷卻、資源、距離或該法術目前能否施放。缺少或受限的已學狀態資料在 NOT 下仍為無法使用。"
-- en: "Only consider auras that you applied yourself."
L["Only consider auras that you applied yourself."] = "僅考慮你自己施加的光環。"
-- en: "Remaining aura time is measured in seconds. Permanent auras have no expiration and do not satisfy a finite refresh threshold. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition. Restricted or unknown timing is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Remaining aura time is measured in seconds. Permanent auras have no expiration and do not satisfy a finite refresh threshold. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition. Restricted or unknown timing is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "光環剩餘時間以秒為單位。永久光環沒有到期時間，不符合有限的刷新門檻。不存在的光環不符合此條件。受限或未知的時間為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "Compare the application count of a matching aura, including charges such as Earth Shield. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition; an unreadable count is unavailable."
L["Compare the application count of a matching aura, including charges such as Earth Shield. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition; an unreadable count is unavailable."] = "比較符合光環的堆疊層數，包括如大地之盾這類的充能次數。不存在的光環不符合此條件；無法讀取的層數為無法使用。"
-- en: "Only consider debuffs returned by the game's dispellable aura filter. This does not guarantee your dispel is ready or in range."
L["Only consider debuffs returned by the game's dispellable aura filter. This does not guarantee your dispel is ready or in range."] = "僅考慮遊戲的可驅散光環過濾器傳回的減益效果。這並不保證你的驅散技能已就緒或在範圍內。"
-- en: "With no off-hand weapon equipped, an off-hand check is false (and true under NOT)."
L["With no off-hand weapon equipped, an off-hand check is false (and true under NOT)."] = "沒有裝備副手武器時，副手檢測為假（在 NOT 下為真）。"
-- en: "Uses the native Attack range check when available. Otherwise it uses LibRangeCheck's public interval to distinguish close range from beyond five yards; that estimate does not prove exact melee geometry for every target. An interval spanning the boundary, missing data or restricted data stays unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Uses the native Attack range check when available. Otherwise it uses LibRangeCheck's public interval to distinguish close range from beyond five yards; that estimate does not prove exact melee geometry for every target. An interval spanning the boundary, missing data or restricted data stays unavailable, including under NOT."] = "在可用時使用原生的「攻擊」距離檢查。否則使用 LibRangeCheck 的公開距離區間來區分近距離與五碼以外；該估算並不能保證對每個目標都精確反映近戰判定。跨越邊界的區間、缺少資料或受限資料維持為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "recharge time on %s"
L["recharge time on %s"] = "%s的充能時間"
-- en: "Seconds until the next spell charge. Full charges and inactive recharge timers report zero. Missing, restricted, or non-charge spell data stays unavailable."
L["Seconds until the next spell charge. Full charges and inactive recharge timers report zero. Missing, restricted, or non-charge spell data stays unavailable."] = "距離下一次法術充能的秒數。充能已滿或充能計時未執行時回報為零。缺少、受限或非充能法術的資料維持為無法使用。"
-- en: "The elemental slot to check: Fire, Earth, Water or Air. Empty, zero-duration and expired totems do not match."
L["The elemental slot to check: Fire, Earth, Water or Air. Empty, zero-duration and expired totems do not match."] = "要檢查的元素欄位：火焰、大地、水或空氣。空的、持續時間為零的與已過期的圖騰不符合。"
-- en: "The active totem to check. Unticked, Use this exact spell rank matches its localized name across ranks. Ticked, it requires the native spell ID; name-only observations are unavailable."
L["The active totem to check. Unticked, Use this exact spell rank matches its localized name across ranks. Ticked, it requires the native spell ID; name-only observations are unavailable."] = "要檢查的生效中圖騰。未勾選「使用這個確切的法術等級」時，依其在地化名稱比對所有等級。勾選後需要原生法術 ID；僅有名稱的觀測為無法使用。"
-- en: "Compare the active totem's remaining seconds with this amount. An absent or expired totem does not match; unavailable observations stay unavailable."
L["Compare the active totem's remaining seconds with this amount. An absent or expired totem does not match; unavailable observations stay unavailable."] = "將生效中圖騰的剩餘秒數與此數值進行比較。不存在或已過期的圖騰不符合；無法使用的觀測維持為無法使用。"
-- en: "This reference belongs to another talent layout. Selecting a talent explicitly replaces it; viewing does not convert it."
L["This reference belongs to another talent layout. Selecting a talent explicitly replaces it; viewing does not convert it."] = "此參照屬於另一種天賦配置。明確選擇一個天賦會取代它；僅檢視不會轉換它。"
-- en: "Historical talent slot %s (unavailable)"
L["Historical talent slot %s (unavailable)"] = "歷史天賦欄位 %s（無法使用）"
-- en: "This client uses a different talent system. This reference is preserved but cannot be evaluated."
L["This client uses a different talent system. This reference is preserved but cannot be evaluated."] = "此用戶端使用不同的天賦系統。此參照會被保留，但無法評估。"
-- en: "Classic conditions compare points spent in a tree talent. Mists selections use six tiers with three choices. Historical references from another talent system remain unavailable and are never automatically converted."
L["Classic conditions compare points spent in a tree talent. Mists selections use six tiers with three choices. Historical references from another talent system remain unavailable and are never automatically converted."] = "經典版條件比較投入在天賦樹某個天賦上的點數。潘達利亞之謎的天賦選擇使用六個層級，每層三選一。來自其他天賦系統的歷史參照維持為無法使用，且永遠不會被自動轉換。"
-- en: "A form is chosen by its spell, so the condition keeps working as new forms are learned and on every client language. Any rank of the form matches. The list shows the forms on your stance bar, then your class's other forms on this client. A condition saved by stance bar slot keeps that slot until you choose a form. If the client cannot read the active form, the condition is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["A form is chosen by its spell, so the condition keeps working as new forms are learned and on every client language. Any rank of the form matches. The list shows the forms on your stance bar, then your class's other forms on this client. A condition saved by stance bar slot keeps that slot until you choose a form. If the client cannot read the active form, the condition is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "形態以其法術選擇，因此隨著學會新形態，該條件仍然有效，並且在所有用戶端語言下都有效。形態的任何等級都會符合。清單先顯示姿態列上的形態，再顯示此用戶端上你職業的其他形態。以姿態列欄位儲存的條件會保留該欄位，直到你選擇一個形態。如果用戶端無法讀取目前形態，該條件無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "Stance bar slot %s (%s)"
L["Stance bar slot %s (%s)"] = "姿態列欄位 %s（%s）"
-- en: "%s cast progress"
L["%s cast progress"] = "%s 施法進度"
-- en: "%s channel progress"
L["%s channel progress"] = "%s 引導進度"
-- en: "Progress"
L["Progress"] = "進度"
-- en: "How much of the current cast of {unit} is done, from 0% when it starts to 100% when it completes. It follows haste and pushback, because it is measured against the cast's own start and end. If the unit is not casting, this condition is not successful, whatever the operator; if the cast's times cannot be read, it is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["How much of the current cast of {unit} is done, from 0% when it starts to 100% when it completes. It follows haste and pushback, because it is measured against the cast's own start and end. If the unit is not casting, this condition is not successful, whatever the operator; if the cast's times cannot be read, it is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "{unit} 目前施法完成了多少，從開始時的 0% 到完成時的 100%。它會隨加速和施法推遲變化，因為它是相對於該次施法本身的開始和結束來衡量的。如果該單位沒有在施法，則無論使用什麼運算子，此條件都不成立；如果無法讀取施法時間，則無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "How much of the current channel of {unit} is done, from 0% when it starts to 100% when it ends. Ticks are evenly spaced through a channel, so tick N of a K-tick channel lands at N/K whatever your haste: to clip Mind Flay (3 ticks) after its second tick, use at least 66%. Pushback shortens a channel and the progress follows it. If the unit is not channeling, this condition is not successful, whatever the operator; if the channel's times cannot be read, it is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["How much of the current channel of {unit} is done, from 0% when it starts to 100% when it ends. Ticks are evenly spaced through a channel, so tick N of a K-tick channel lands at N/K whatever your haste: to clip Mind Flay (3 ticks) after its second tick, use at least 66%. Pushback shortens a channel and the progress follows it. If the unit is not channeling, this condition is not successful, whatever the operator; if the channel's times cannot be read, it is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "{unit} 目前引導完成了多少，從開始時的 0% 到結束時的 100%。跳數在引導過程中均勻分布，因此 K 跳引導的第 N 跳無論加速如何都落在 N/K：要在第二跳之後打斷精神鞭笞（3 跳），請使用至少 66%。施法推遲會縮短引導，進度隨之變化。如果該單位沒有在引導，則無論使用什麼運算子，此條件都不成立；如果無法讀取引導時間，則無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "Talent tree %s"
L["Talent tree %s"] = "天賦樹 %s"
-- en: "This client does not expose a Classic talent-tree layout. The saved tree reference is preserved."
L["This client does not expose a Classic talent-tree layout. The saved tree reference is preserved."] = "此用戶端未提供經典版天賦樹配置。已儲存的天賦樹參照會被保留。"
-- en: "Talent tree"
L["Talent tree"] = "天賦樹"
-- en: "the number of points spent in %s"
L["the number of points spent in %s"] = "%s中投入的點數"
-- en: "Talent tree selects the Classic tree whose spent points are compared. Public points are read again on the next evaluation; missing or restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."
L["Talent tree selects the Classic tree whose spent points are compared. Public points are read again on the next evaluation; missing or restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."] = "「天賦樹」選擇要比較已投入點數的經典版天賦樹。公開點數會在下一次評估時重新讀取；缺少或受限的點數為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。不支援網格天賦與特質樹。"
-- en: "Compare whole points spent from zero to 512. An explicit comparison with zero can describe an unspent tree."
L["Compare whole points spent from zero to 512. An explicit comparison with zero can describe an unspent tree."] = "比較已投入的整數點數，範圍為 0 到 512。明確與零比較可用來描述未投點的天賦樹。"
-- en: "Talent trees are named, never numbered: the list shows each tree by name, in the order the talent window shows them, for the class the rotation is for. Your own class takes the names the game gives its trees; another class's rotation uses Rotation Master's own list of that class's trees. The rotation saves the tree's position in that order, so it keeps its meaning when you share it."
L["Talent trees are named, never numbered: the list shows each tree by name, in the order the talent window shows them, for the class the rotation is for. Your own class takes the names the game gives its trees; another class's rotation uses Rotation Master's own list of that class's trees. The rotation saves the tree's position in that order, so it keeps its meaning when you share it."] = "天賦樹以名稱顯示，而不是編號：清單依天賦視窗的順序，為該輪替所針對的職業逐一顯示各個天賦樹的名稱。你自己的職業使用遊戲給其天賦樹的名稱；其他職業的輪替則使用 Rotation Master 內建的該職業天賦樹清單。輪替儲存的是天賦樹在該順序中的位置，因此分享後含義不變。"
-- en: "Talent tree selects the unique Classic tree with the most positive spent points. Equal maxima, no spent points, missing records and restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Talent tree selects the unique Classic tree with the most positive spent points. Equal maxima, no spent points, missing records and restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT."] = "「天賦樹」選擇投入點數最多（且大於零）的唯一經典版天賦樹。最大值相同、未投入點數、記錄缺少與受限點數均為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "The primary tree is derived from readable points, not the saved rotation slot. Hybrid builds may need tree-point or individual-talent conditions instead; the primary tree does not assign a tank or healer role. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."
L["The primary tree is derived from readable points, not the saved rotation slot. Hybrid builds may need tree-point or individual-talent conditions instead; the primary tree does not assign a tank or healer role. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."] = "主要天賦樹由可讀的點數推算得出，而不是已儲存的循環欄位。混合天賦配置可能需要改用天賦樹點數或單一天賦條件；主要天賦樹不會指定坦克或治療職責。不支援網格天賦與特質樹。"
-- en: "Item sets are checked in priority order. Bag counts use the first carried candidate, not the sum. Availability, range and cooldown checks use the first carried or equipped candidate. Missing or restricted observations stay unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Item sets are checked in priority order. Bag counts use the first carried candidate, not the sum. Availability, range and cooldown checks use the first carried or equipped candidate. Missing or restricted observations stay unavailable, including under NOT."] = "物品組依優先順序檢查。背包數量使用第一個攜帶的候選物品，而不是總和。可用性、距離與冷卻檢查使用第一個攜帶或已裝備的候選物品。缺少或受限的觀測維持為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "Item Available checks the required level and enabled item cooldown. An active cooldown qualifies only when it ends with the readable global cooldown. This condition does not bypass the action's implicit ownership, usability and range checks."
L["Item Available checks the required level and enabled item cooldown. An active cooldown qualifies only when it ends with the readable global cooldown. This condition does not bypass the action's implicit ownership, usability and range checks."] = "「物品可用」會檢查所需等級與已啟用的物品冷卻。只有當冷卻隨可讀的共用冷卻一同結束時，正在進行的冷卻才算符合。此條件不會繞過動作隱含的擁有、可用性與距離檢查。"
