-- en: "Matches when the selected unit is dead or a ghost. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable, including under NOT. In a Via Macro announcement, choose Announcement target to follow the supplied unit."
L["Matches when the selected unit is dead or a ghost. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable, including under NOT. In a Via Macro announcement, choose Announcement target to follow the supplied unit."] = "當所選單位已死亡或處於鬼魂狀態時符合。缺少或無法讀取的單位為無法使用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。在「透過巨集」的通報中，選擇「通報目標」可跟隨所提供的單位。"
-- en: "Matches when the game reports the selected unit as friendly to you. This does not imply party or raid membership. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable."
L["Matches when the game reports the selected unit as friendly to you. This does not imply party or raid membership. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable."] = "當遊戲回報所選單位對你友好時符合。這並不代表它是隊伍或團隊成員。缺少或無法讀取的單位為無法使用。"
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} suggesting a spell"
L["Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} suggesting a spell"] = "戰鬥助手{{!正在|沒有}}建議法術"
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!suggests|does not suggest}} %s"
L["Assisted Combat {{!suggests|does not suggest}} %s"] = "戰鬥助手{{!建議|不建議}}%s"
-- en: "Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."
L["Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."] = "當暴雪的戰鬥助手建議以此法術作為下一個施放的法術時符合。覆蓋法術視同其基礎法術，基礎法術也視同其覆蓋法術。未選擇法術時，只要戰鬥助手有任何建議就符合。"
-- en: "Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."
L["Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."] = "戰鬥助手存在於正式版（並在永久中宣告）。若遊戲未為此角色或專精提供該功能，或無法讀取建議，此條件為無法使用而非假，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "%s {{!is|is not}} in Blizzard's Assisted Combat rotation"
L["%s {{!is|is not}} in Blizzard's Assisted Combat rotation"] = "%s {{!在|不在}}暴雪戰鬥助手的循環中"
-- en: "Matches when this spell is one Blizzard's Assisted Combat can suggest for your current specialization. Its current override and its base spell count too. Use it to highlight what Assisted Combat leaves out, for example a cooldown that is not in the set."
L["Matches when this spell is one Blizzard's Assisted Combat can suggest for your current specialization. Its current override and its base spell count too. Use it to highlight what Assisted Combat leaves out, for example a cooldown that is not in the set."] = "當該法術是暴雪戰鬥助手可以為你目前專精建議的法術之一時符合。它目前的替換法術和基礎法術也算。用它來醒目提示戰鬥助手遺漏的內容，例如不在該集合中的冷卻。"
-- en: "The set is read again whenever your spells change, never guessed. Where the game does not offer Assisted Combat for this character or specialization, or the set cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."
L["The set is read again whenever your spells change, never guessed. Where the game does not offer Assisted Combat for this character or specialization, or the set cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."] = "該集合在你的法術每次改變時都會重新讀取，絕不猜測。如果遊戲沒有為此角色或專精提供戰鬥助手，或無法讀取該集合，則此條件無法使用而不是為假，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} available"
L["Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} available"] = "戰鬥助手{{!可用|無法使用}}"
-- en: "Matches when the game offers Blizzard's Assisted Combat for your character and current specialization. When it does not (for example a specialization Blizzard has no Assisted Combat rotation for, or a client that declares the API but does not offer the feature), this is false, so a branch can fall back to your own steps."
L["Matches when the game offers Blizzard's Assisted Combat for your character and current specialization. When it does not (for example a specialization Blizzard has no Assisted Combat rotation for, or a client that declares the API but does not offer the feature), this is false, so a branch can fall back to your own steps."] = "當遊戲為你的角色和目前專精提供暴雪戰鬥助手時符合。不提供時（例如暴雪沒有戰鬥助手循環的專精，或宣告了 API 卻不提供該功能的用戶端），結果為假，因此分支可以退回到你自己的步驟。"
-- en: "Unavailable only where the client has no Assisted Combat API or its answer cannot be read, including under NOT."
