L["Engraving exists only on Season of Discovery realms. Elsewhere, and until your runes have loaded after logging in, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT. The Phase 7 shoulder runes are not engravings and are not seen. This is not the Death Knight Rune condition."] = "銘刻只存在於探索賽季伺服器。在其他情況下，以及登入後你的符文載入完成之前，此條件無法使用而不是為假，在 NOT 下同樣如此。第七階段的肩部符文不是銘刻，不會被辨識。這不是死亡騎士的符文條件。"
