-- en: "Retail and Forever compare the rank of a talent in your active loadout. Pick it from the talents of the rotation's specialization (the Specialization list shows another specialization's, outside combat), or enter the node ID (and, for a choice node, the entry ID of the choice) to share a rotation. A choice node's entry has rank zero unless it is the chosen one, a hero talent outside your chosen hero tree has rank zero, and so does a talent of a specialization you are not playing. A talent picked from the list also remembers its spell, and is found again by it if Blizzard renumbers the talent tree. Ranks are read again after any talent change; an unreadable node is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Retail and Forever compare the rank of a talent in your active loadout. Pick it from the talents of the rotation's specialization (the Specialization list shows another specialization's, outside combat), or enter the node ID (and, for a choice node, the entry ID of the choice) to share a rotation. A choice node's entry has rank zero unless it is the chosen one, a hero talent outside your chosen hero tree has rank zero, and so does a talent of a specialization you are not playing. A talent picked from the list also remembers its spell, and is found again by it if Blizzard renumbers the talent tree. Ranks are read again after any talent change; an unreadable node is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "正式服與 Forever 會比較你目前配置中某個天賦的等級。請從該循環所屬專精的天賦中選擇（「專精」清單可在戰鬥之外顯示其他專精的天賦），或輸入節點 ID（選擇節點還需輸入所選項目的項目 ID）以分享循環。選擇節點中未被選中的項目等級為零；你所選英雄天賦樹之外的英雄天賦等級為零，你目前未使用的專精的天賦也是如此。從清單中選取的天賦還會記住其法術，當暴雪重新編號天賦樹時可憑法術重新找到它。每次天賦變動後都會重新讀取等級；無法讀取的節點視為不可用，在 NOT 下同樣如此。"
-- en: "Talents of another specialization cannot be loaded during combat. A node ID entered below is kept and evaluated."
L["Talents of another specialization cannot be loaded during combat. A node ID entered below is kept and evaluated."] = "無法在戰鬥中載入其他專精的天賦。下方輸入的節點 ID 會被保留並參與判斷。"
-- en: "Opens the talent tree of the rotation's specialization. Click a talent to choose it for this condition."
L["Opens the talent tree of the rotation's specialization. Click a talent to choose it for this condition."] = "開啟此輪替專精的天賦樹。點擊一個天賦，即可為此條件選擇它。"
-- en: "Show talent tree draws the talent tree of the specialization shown, with every talent open to choose. Click a talent to choose it, or click the chosen one again to clear it; the Talent list follows. It cannot open during combat."
L["Show talent tree draws the talent tree of the specialization shown, with every talent open to choose. Click a talent to choose it, or click the chosen one again to clear it; the Talent list follows. It cannot open during combat."] = "「顯示天賦樹」會繪製所示專精的天賦樹，所有天賦皆可選擇。點擊一個天賦即可選擇，再次點擊已選天賦即可清除；天賦清單會隨之更新。戰鬥中無法開啟。"
-- en: "Forever is the exception: Talent tree is one of the three talent trees of your active loadout (in the order the talent window shows them); their points are read again after any talent change. Retail has no such trees."
L["Forever is the exception: Talent tree is one of the three talent trees of your active loadout (in the order the talent window shows them); their points are read again after any talent change. Retail has no such trees."] = "永久服是例外：天賦樹是你目前啟用配置的三棵天賦樹之一（依天賦視窗顯示的順序）；它們的點數會在任何天賦改變後重新讀取。正式版沒有這樣的天賦樹。"
